§ `s 265(d) The corporation from the effective time`

-- Upon the effective time of the two certificates the other entity is converted to a corporation of this State, subject to all the provisions of the title.
-- src:1338 | (d) Upon the effective time of the certificate of conversion to corporation and the certificate of incorporation, the other entity shall be converted to a corporation of this State and the corporation shall thereafter be subject to all of the provisions of this title, …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(d) (src:1338)
GIVEN `the effective date of the certificate of conversion to corporation and the certificate of incorporation` IS A DATE
      `the day in question` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(d) the other entity has been converted to a corporation of this State` MEANS
    `the day in question` AT LEAST `the effective date of the certificate of conversion to corporation and the certificate of incorporation`

-- "except that notwithstanding § 106 of this title, the existence of the corporation shall be deemed to have commenced on the date the other entity
-- commenced its existence in the jurisdiction in which the other entity was first created, formed, incorporated or otherwise came into being."
-- Section 106 (piece dg1) would date it from the certificate of incorporation; this subsection displaces that.
-- src:1338 | except that notwithstanding § 106 of this title, the existence of the corporation shall be deemed to have commenced on the date the other entity commenced its existence in the jurisdiction in which the other entity was first created, formed, incorporated or otherwise came into being.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(d) (src:1338)
GIVEN `the date the other entity commenced its existence in the jurisdiction in which it was first created, formed, incorporated or otherwise came into being` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 265(d) the date on which the existence of the corporation is deemed to have commenced` MEANS
    `the date the other entity commenced its existence in the jurisdiction in which it was first created, formed, incorporated or otherwise came into being`

§ `s 265(e) Obligations and liabilities incurred before the conversion`

-- The conversion is not deemed to affect an obligation or liability of the other entity incurred before it, or the personal liability of any person incurred before it.
-- The subsection says nothing about one incurred after the conversion, so that case is not covered (NOTHING).
-- src:1339 | (e) The conversion of any other entity to a corporation of this State shall not be deemed to affect any obligations or liabilities of the other entity incurred prior to its conversion to a corporation of this State or the personal liability of any person incurred prior to such conversion.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(e) (src:1339)
GIVEN `the obligation, liability or personal liability was incurred before the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 265(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` MEANS
    IF `the obligation, liability or personal liability was incurred before the conversion`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

§ `s 265(f) The effect of a conversion on rights, property and debts`

-- src:1340 | (f) When an other entity has been converted to a corporation of this State pursuant to this section, the corporation of this State shall, for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware, be deemed to be the same entity as the converting other entity. …
-- src:1340 | When any conversion shall have become effective under this section, for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware, all of the rights, privileges and powers of the other entity that has converted, and all property, real, personal and mixed, and all debts due to such other entity, as well as all other things and causes of action belonging to such other entity, shall remain vested in the domestic corporation to which such other entity has converted and shall be the property of such domestic corporation and the title to any real property vested by deed or otherwise in such other entity shall not revert or be in any way impaired by reason of this chapter; …
-- src:1340 | but all rights of creditors and all liens upon any property of such other entity shall be preserved unimpaired, and all debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity that has converted shall remain attached to the corporation of this State to which such other entity has converted, and may be enforced against it to the same extent as if said debts, liabilities and duties had originally been incurred or contracted by it in its capacity as a corporation of this State. …
-- src:1340 | The rights, privileges, powers and interests in property of the other entity, as well as the debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity, shall not be deemed, as a consequence of the conversion, to have been transferred to the domestic corporation to which such other entity has converted for any purpose of the laws of the State of Delaware.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(f) (src:1340)
DECLARE `s 265(f) Effect of a conversion that has become effective` IS ONE OF
    `the corporation is deemed to be the same entity as the converting other entity under s 265(f)`
    `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the other entity remain vested in the corporation under s 265(f)`
    `title to real property vested in the other entity does not revert or become impaired under s 265(f)`
    `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the other entity are preserved unimpaired under s 265(f)`
    `all debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity remain attached to the corporation and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it as a corporation under s 265(f)`
    `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity are not deemed to have been transferred to the corporation under s 265(f)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(f) (src:1340)
GIVEN `the conversion has become effective under the section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `s 265(f) Effect of a conversion that has become effective`
`s 265(f) the effects of the conversion` MEANS
    IF `the conversion has become effective under the section`
    THEN LIST `the corporation is deemed to be the same entity as the converting other entity under s 265(f)`
            , `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the other entity remain vested in the corporation under s 265(f)`
            , `title to real property vested in the other entity does not revert or become impaired under s 265(f)`
            , `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the other entity are preserved unimpaired under s 265(f)`
            , `all debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity remain attached to the corporation and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it as a corporation under s 265(f)`
            , `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the other entity are not deemed to have been transferred to the corporation under s 265(f)`
    ELSE EMPTY

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(f) (src:1340)
GIVEN effect IS A `s 265(f) Effect of a conversion that has become effective`
      `the conversion has become effective under the section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(f) the effect follows from the conversion` MEANS
    elem effect (`s 265(f) the effects of the conversion` `the conversion has become effective under the section`)

§ `s 265(g) No winding up; a continuation, not a dissolution`

-- "Unless otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware or as required under applicable non-Delaware law": the unless-clause is read as governing both
-- limbs of the sentence (fork F5). The agreement and the non-Delaware law are inputs.
-- src:1341 | (g) Unless otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware or as required under applicable non-Delaware law, the converting other entity shall not be required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets, and the conversion shall not be deemed to constitute a dissolution of such other entity and shall constitute a continuation of the existence of the converting other entity in the form of a corporation of this State.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(g) (src:1341)
GIVEN `it is otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN
      `applicable non-Delaware law requires otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(g) the converting other entity is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` MEANS
        (NOT `it is otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware`)
    AND (NOT `applicable non-Delaware law requires otherwise`)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(g) (src:1341)
GIVEN `it is otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware` IS A BOOLEAN
      `applicable non-Delaware law requires otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(g) the conversion is a continuation of the existence of the other entity in the form of a corporation and not a dissolution` MEANS
        (NOT `it is otherwise agreed for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware`)
    AND (NOT `applicable non-Delaware law requires otherwise`)

§ `s 265(h) Approval of the conversion`

-- Before the certificate of conversion becomes effective under section 103, the conversion is approved in the manner the governing writing of the other
-- entity or the applicable law provides, and the certificate of incorporation is approved by the same authorization.
-- src:1342 | (h) Prior to the time a certificate of conversion to corporation becomes effective in accordance with § 103 of this title, the conversion shall be approved in the manner provided for by the document, instrument, agreement or other writing, as the case may be, governing the internal affairs of the other entity and the conduct of its business or by applicable law, as appropriate, and a certificate of incorporation shall be approved by the same authorization required to approve the conversion.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(h) (src:1342)
GIVEN `the conversion was approved in the manner provided for by the writing governing the internal affairs of the other entity and the conduct of its business, or by applicable law, as appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the conversion was approved before the certificate of conversion to corporation became effective in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
      `the certificate of incorporation was approved by the same authorization as was required to approve the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(h) the conversion is approved as the subsection requires` MEANS
        `the conversion was approved in the manner provided for by the writing governing the internal affairs of the other entity and the conduct of its business, or by applicable law, as appropriate`
    AND `the conversion was approved before the certificate of conversion to corporation became effective in accordance with § 103`
    AND `the certificate of incorporation was approved by the same authorization as was required to approve the conversion`

§ `s 265(i) Signing the certificate of conversion`

-- src:1343 | (i) The certificate of conversion to corporation shall be signed by any person who is authorized to sign the certificate of conversion to corporation on behalf of the other entity.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(i) (src:1343)
GIVEN `the certificate of conversion to corporation was signed by a person who is authorized to sign it on behalf of the other entity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(i) the certificate of conversion to corporation is signed as the subsection requires` MEANS
    `the certificate of conversion to corporation was signed by a person who is authorized to sign it on behalf of the other entity`

§ `s 265(j) Exchanging, converting or cancelling rights, securities and interests`

-- src:1344 | (j) In connection with a conversion hereunder, rights or securities of, or interests in, the other entity which is to be converted to a corporation of this State may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of such corporation of this State or, in addition to or in lieu thereof, may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of or interests in another domestic corporation or other entity or may be cancelled.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(j) (src:1344)
DECLARE `s 265(j) Treatment of a right, security or interest in the other entity` IS ONE OF
    `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of the corporation of this State`
    `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of or interests in another domestic corporation or other entity`
    `cancelled`
    `any treatment that subsection (j) does not list`

-- The three treatments the subsection lists are permitted. Any other treatment is not covered by the subsection (NOTHING).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(j) (src:1344)
GIVEN treatment IS A `s 265(j) Treatment of a right, security or interest in the other entity`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 265(j) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` MEANS
    CONSIDER treatment
    WHEN `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of the corporation of this State` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of or interests in another domestic corporation or other entity` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `cancelled` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 265(k) The plan of conversion`

-- The converting other entity may adopt a plan of conversion that may state six things; each corporate action it states requires approval in accordance with
-- all law applicable to the other entity (an input).
-- src:1345 | (k) In connection with a conversion under this section, the converting other entity may adopt a plan of conversion that may state: (i) the terms and conditions of the conversion, (ii) that the certificate of incorporation of the converted corporation of this State shall be as set forth in attachment to the plan of conversion, (iii) the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the other entity that is to be converted to a corporation of this State, in accordance with subsection (j) of this section, (iv) any corporate action to be taken by the converted corporation of this State in connection with the conversion of the other entity, each of which shall require approval in accordance with all law applicable to the other entity, including any approval required under such applicable law for the authorization of the type of corporate action specified in the plan of conversion, (v) any details or provisions as are deemed desirable, and (vi) such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the other entity. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
DECLARE `s 265(k) Matter a plan of conversion may state` IS ONE OF
    `the terms and conditions of the conversion under s 265(k)(i)`
    `that the certificate of incorporation of the converted corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the plan under s 265(k)(ii)`
    `the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the other entity under s 265(k)(iii)`
    `any corporate action to be taken by the converted corporation in connection with the conversion under s 265(k)(iv)`
    `any details or provisions that are deemed desirable under s 265(k)(v)`
    `such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the other entity under s 265(k)(vi)`
    `any matter that subsection (k) does not list`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
GIVEN matter IS A `s 265(k) Matter a plan of conversion may state`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 265(k) the plan of conversion may state the matter` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    WHEN `any matter that subsection (k) does not list` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
GIVEN `the corporate action is stated in the plan of conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the corporate action was approved in accordance with all law applicable to the other entity, including any approval required under that law for the type of corporate action specified in the plan` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(k)(iv) the corporate action stated in the plan is approved as the subsection requires` MEANS
        (NOT `the corporate action is stated in the plan of conversion`)
    OR  `the corporate action was approved in accordance with all law applicable to the other entity, including any approval required under that law for the type of corporate action specified in the plan`

-- A term of the plan may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan, provided that the manner in which the facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan.
-- (The sentence after it, on what "facts" includes, is the next rule.)
-- src:1345 | Any of the terms of the plan of conversion may be made dependent upon facts ascertainable outside of such plan, provided that the manner in which such facts shall operate upon the terms of the plan of conversion is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan of conversion. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
GIVEN `the term depends on facts ascertainable outside the plan` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the manner in which those facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(k) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` MEANS
        (NOT `the term depends on facts ascertainable outside the plan`)
    OR  `the manner in which those facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan`

-- The sentence after it: "The term “facts,” as used in the preceding sentence, includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation."
-- "Includes, but is not limited to" makes the list of facts open; it does not make everything a fact. An event, and a determination or action by any person or body
-- (including the other entity or the converted corporation), are facts; for anything else the text does not say, so the rule answers NOTHING (fork F26).
-- src:1345 | The term “facts,” as used in the preceding sentence, includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
DECLARE `s 265(k) Kind of fact` IS ONE OF
    `the occurrence of an event under s 265(k)`
    `a determination by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation, under s 265(k)`
    `an action by any person or body, including the other entity or the converted corporation, under s 265(k)`
    `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 265(k)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(k) (src:1345)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 265(k) Kind of fact`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 265(k) the kind of fact is within the term facts` kind MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 265(k)` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

§ `s 265(l) Corporate action set forth in the plan`

-- A corporate action set forth in a plan of conversion approved as subsection (k) provides, and within the power of a corporation under Subchapter II
-- (piece dg2: an input), is deemed authorized, adopted and approved by the converted corporation and by its board of directors, stockholders or members,
-- and needs no further action of the board, stockholders or members under the title.
-- src:1346 | (l) Any corporate action to be taken by the converted corporation of this State in connection with the conversion of the other entity that is set forth in a plan of conversion approved in the manner provided for by subsection (k) of this section and that is within the power of a corporation under subchapter II of this chapter shall be deemed authorized, adopted and approved, as applicable, by the converted corporation of this State and the board of directors, stockholders or members of the corporation, as applicable, and shall not require any further action of the board of directors, stockholders or members of the corporation under this title. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(l) (src:1346)
GIVEN `the corporate action is set forth in a plan of conversion approved in the manner provided for by subsection (k)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the corporate action is within the power of a corporation under Subchapter II` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: Subchapter II (piece dg2)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(l) the corporate action is deemed authorized, adopted and approved and needs no further action of the board, stockholders or members` MEANS
        `the corporate action is set forth in a plan of conversion approved in the manner provided for by subsection (k)`
    AND `the corporate action is within the power of a corporation under Subchapter II`

-- "In the event that any such action requires the filing of a certificate under any other section of this title, the certificate shall state that in accordance with
-- this section, no action by the board of directors, stockholders, members or as otherwise required by such other section of this title is required."
-- src:1346 | In the event that any such action requires the filing of a certificate under any other section of this title, the certificate shall state that in accordance with this section, no action by the board of directors, stockholders, members or as otherwise required by such other section of this title is required.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 265(l) (src:1346)
GIVEN `the deemed authorization applies to the corporate action` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the action requires the filing of a certificate under another section of this title` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate states that in accordance with section 265 no action by the board of directors, stockholders, members or as otherwise required by the other section is required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 265(l) the certificate filed under another section is as the subsection requires` MEANS
        (NOT (`the deemed authorization applies to the corporate action` AND `the action requires the filing of a certificate under another section of this title`))
    OR  `the certificate states that in accordance with section 265 no action by the board of directors, stockholders, members or as otherwise required by the other section is required`
